[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 540.87, "timestamp": "00:09:00", "text": "之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.67, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "如果你听到我室友的声音，请不要在意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 545.91, "timestamp": "00:09:05", "text": "他。 一秒钟（音乐）。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 548.07, "timestamp": "00:09:08", "text": "嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 550.15, "timestamp": "00:09:10", "text": "我住在合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.75, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "租房"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 553.471, "timestamp": "00:09:13", "text": "或者公寓里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 553.55, "timestamp": "00:09:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.43, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "嗯哼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.43, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "，我现在有室友了。 是的。 所以，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 561.75, "timestamp": "00:09:21", "text": "做饭，我做清洁之类的家务。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 564.15, "timestamp": "00:09:24", "text": "。 我本来应该在一周前上传"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 567.99, "timestamp": "00:09:27", "text": "视频，呃，不是视频，是博客"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 571.35, "timestamp": "00:09:31", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 573.95, "timestamp": "00:09:33", "text": "但我迟到了。 我必须去做一些事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 575.87, "timestamp": "00:09:35", "text": "我当时很忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 578.27, "timestamp": "00:09:38", "text": "是啊，我一点空闲时间都不想有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 579.31, "timestamp": "00:09:39", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 581.95, "timestamp": "00:09:41", "text": "所以，我原本应该更早发布这个视频博客，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.11, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "而不是今天。 我知道我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 588.55, "timestamp": "00:09:48", "text": "大概一个小时前才发布，现在却"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.07, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.99, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "你相信吗？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 597.63, "timestamp": "00:09:57", "text": "，所以是一些公告。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.11, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "既然"}]